      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "26．а）如果 $a=10$，$0.3$，$0$，$-2.7$，$-9$，求 $|a|$；",
        "б）如果 $|a|=6$，$|a|=3.2$，$|a|=0$，求 $a$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3．分母不同的分式的和"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在提出的问题是：把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分",
        "式．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "应用分式的基本性质，我们可以把这个问题归结为前一",
        "小节所研究的同分母分式的加法问题．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为此，把前一个分式的分子与分母同乘以 $d$，而把后一个",
        "分式的分子与分母同乘以 $b$，得到："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "式 $d$ 叫做分式 $\\frac ab$ 的分子与分母的附加因式，式 $b$ 是分式",
        "$\\frac cd$ 的分子与分母的附加因式．我们已经把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 变形成"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "同分母的分式 $\\frac{ad}{bd}$ 与 $\\frac{bc}{bd}$．这时就说，分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 已经通分．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "现在可以把分式 $\\frac ab$ 与 $\\frac cd$ 的和表示成一个分式："
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\frac ab+\\frac cd=\\frac{ad}{bd}+\\frac{bc}{bd}=\\frac{ad+bc}{bd}$．"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "对于使其左右两边有意义的所有变量值，等式 $\\frac ab+\\frac cd$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "10"
      ]
    }
  ]
